        entry at="2026-08-23T00:51:49Z" by="agent:praxis" action="state-changed" from="open" to="closed" note="closed by `praxis close`. The accounting was computed; the conclusion is not the machine's to draw"

        entry at="2026-08-23T00:48:17Z" by="agent:praxis" action="created" \
